    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In Britain, Australia, Canada and some other places, the day after Christmas is a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "national",
            "ref": "v-national"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "holiday",
            "ref": "v-holiday"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It is called Boxing Day."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "No Need for Boxing Gloves"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The day actually has "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "nothing to do with",
            "zh": "与……无关"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the sport of boxing. Then how did it get its name?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It may have come from a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tradition",
            "ref": "v-tradition"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " among the rich. They would give a “Christmas Box” to their "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "servants",
            "ref": "v-servant"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and other workers. There were often gifts and money in the boxes. The workers would also have that "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "day off",
            "zh": "休假"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "And some say the tradition came from the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Romans",
            "zh": "古罗马人"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They would "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "collect",
            "ref": "v-collect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " money in boxes. When they came to Britain, they brought this tradition with them. Then "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "churches",
            "ref": "v-church"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " began to put boxes outside their doors. So, they could collect money for the poor."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "If They’re Not Boxing, What Do People Do on Boxing Day?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Boxing Day has become a day of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "relaxation",
            "zh": "放松"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—and shopping. There are sports to watch. People open their homes for family and friends to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "stop by",
            "ref": "v-stop-by"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". And of course, there are “"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Boxing Day Sales",
            "zh": "促销"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "”!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
